---
import IconCheck from '@/assets/icons/icon-check.svg'
---
<section class="py-5 main-container">
  <div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto rounded-sm bg-[#c4c1c11f] px-4 md:px-8 xl:px-12 py-8 md:py-12">
    <h2 class="text-h2 text-primary text-center">Get in touch With Us</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-body mt-10">
      <p>Simply Enak is one of the Leading Food Tour businesses in Malaysia with events in Kuala Lumpur and Penang. We have been trusted with a 5-star ranking on TripAdvisor as well as the TripAdvisor Certificate of Excellence for 4 consecutive years. We always aim to give you the best experience possible.</p>
      <b>Send us a message when you…</b>
      <ul class="pl-4 space-y-1 pt-2">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <IconCheck class="size-4 min-w-4 text-primary" />
          Are unclear about which tour to book.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <IconCheck class="size-4 min-w-4 text-primary" />
          Have a last-minute request.*
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <IconCheck class="size-4 min-w-4 text-primary" />
          Have a larger group.**
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>*Remember to mention your preferred tour location (Kuala Lumpur or Penang) and all possible ways to contact you, so you have a better chance to join a tour. We will try to SMS (not call) your number when you provide us with your phone number.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full mt-10 md:mt-16">
      <iframe  height="750" allowtransparency="true" style="width:100%;border:none" src="https://formaloo.net/tmzwx" id="formalooIframe" spellcheck="false" aria-label="To enrich screen reader interactions, please activate Accessibility in Grammarly extension settings"></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>